{
  "job_C16.2_20251003_115216": {
    "chunk_text": "on. Qui recumbit, cito conualescit aut longum periculum sustinebit se\u00fee geli\u00f0 ra\u00f0e he hamacga\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e Puer natus animosus, cupidus de rebus alienis; raro erit senex; non bona morte morietur cild acenned Puella similiter, & laboriosa; multos uiros cupit, & non erit uetula meden ealswa, & geswincful; feala Somnium uacuum est swefen ydel ys. Non est bona luna sanguinem minuere nis na god mona blod l\u00e6tan. Luna IIII; opera incipere, pueros in scolam mittere utilis est mona se feor\u00fea wercu onginnan, cildru on Qui fugit, cito inuenitur se\u00fee fl\u00e6h\u00f0, ra\u00fee funden. Qui recumbit, cito moritur, uel uix euadat se\u00fee gely\u00f0, ra\u00f0 he swylt, o\u00f0\u00f0e unea\u00fee he \u00e6twnt. Qui nascitur, fornicator erit annos duodecim se\u00fee bi\u00f0 acenned, forligende gear twelfe. Si euaserit, diues erit; periculum habet gif he \u00e6twint w\u00e6lig he bi\u00f0; fr\u00e6cednysse he h\u00e6f. Puella similiter m\u00e6den \u00fe\u00e6t selfe. Somnium, siue bonum siue malum, effectum habet swefne, swaw\u00e6derswa god swa yfel, gefremminge Ab hora sexta usque nonam bona luna sanguinem minuere fram tide \u00fe\u00e6r syxtan o\u00f0 non god mona blod Luna quinta; non dabis sacramentum, quia periurium mona se fifta, \u00feu na selle offrunga, for\u00fei a\u00f0sware. Qui fugit, cito nuntiatur mortuus, uel ligatus reuertitur se\u00fee",
